{"parse": {"title": "新芽之钥", "pageid": 110272, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"新芽之钥\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/49/Item-620104.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"新芽之钥\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>新芽之钥</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#620104</div></div><hr /><div>缠绕于脑内，于灰烬中复苏的闪光奇想，如今探出蓬勃新芽。用于解锁槲寄生的闪念。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">如一株曾被烧毁的枯木，我知晓其灰与火的过往，亦知晓新芽挣扎时的啼哭。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">来源</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">函电汇报</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "新芽之钥"}}